I told her I was working with Lynch.

01:16:32.050 --> 01:16:35.480
She and her son are gonna meet us at the old Daytona band show in about an hour.

01:16:35.480 --> 01:16:38.710
It's a 45-mile drive from here, so we should just make it.

01:16:38.710 --> 01:16:39.570
Her son?

01:16:39.570 --> 01:16:41.140
Yeah.

01:16:41.140 --> 01:16:42.140
Well, that complicates things.

01:16:42.140 --> 01:16:45.810
Yeah, but at least Quint hasn't gotten to her yet.

01:17:28.220 --> 01:17:30.000
- Can we go swimming? - Not today, honey.

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:41.340
We have an important meeting with a man.

01:17:41.340 --> 01:17:56.280
She is.

01:18:24.890 --> 01:18:25.970
- Tom.

01:18:25.970 --> 01:18:26.810
- Oh my God.

01:18:26.810 --> 01:18:27.590
It's Quint.

01:18:27.590 --> 01:18:29.960
- Mearden?

01:18:30.640 --> 01:18:33.340
Oh, thank God Lynch sent you. What is happening?

01:18:33.340 --> 01:18:45.970
I really need to go. Right now.

01:18:45.970 --> 01:18:46.900
Ryan?

01:20:09.340 --> 01:20:11.290
What's next?

01:20:11.290 --> 01:20:13.800
What's next?

01:20:13.800 --> 01:20:18.020
We're supposed to be finding Ryan.

01:20:18.020 --> 01:20:21.850
Aren't you planning on doing anything?

01:20:21.850 --> 01:20:25.700
Right now, I'm doing plenty.

01:20:25.700 --> 01:20:28.200
Because of you, my son is missing.

01:20:30.760 --> 01:20:32.180
And all you can do is drink?

01:20:33.450 --> 01:20:36.420
Caitlin, we're doing everything we can.

01:20:36.970 --> 01:20:39.220
Miss Palmer, the ball's no longer in our court.

01:20:39.320 --> 01:20:41.910
I mean, as soon as we can find this guy, it'll...

01:20:41.910 --> 01:20:45.330
Right on cue.

01:20:46.750 --> 01:20:47.030
Hello?

01:20:59.210 --> 01:20:59.570
Palmer.

01:21:00.220 --> 01:21:04.330
We met earlier today. Your friend still with you?

01:21:04.330 --> 01:21:09.980
Yes. Where's my son? What have you done with him?

01:21:09.980 --> 01:21:12.800
Why don't you bring your little party over to our place?

01:21:12.800 --> 01:21:18.030
There's an airfield on the end of Mannheim Road.

01:21:18.030 --> 01:21:29.060
Oh, and Miss Palmer, don't bring any uninvited guests or you'll never see your boy alive again.

01:21:30.000 --> 01:21:31.320
Wait a minute. Let me speak to Ryan.

01:21:32.660 --> 01:21:32.900
Hello?

01:21:33.360 --> 01:21:40.010
He hung up.

01:21:43.850 --> 01:21:44.850
They don't want to harm your son.

01:21:46.730 --> 01:21:47.710
They have no use for him.

01:21:48.490 --> 01:21:49.360
I know.

01:21:50.040 --> 01:21:51.650
They want me.

01:22:30.830 --> 01:22:33.140
Propagation of the species.

01:22:37.260 --> 01:22:39.440
Why, you little bastard?

01:22:39.440 --> 01:23:00.000
Caitlyn Palmer over and I'll release them.

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:15.450
I'm worried about you.

01:23:15.950 --> 01:23:16.890
Are you alright?

01:23:17.200 --> 01:23:17.960
Yes, Mom.

01:23:18.100 --> 01:23:19.100
You sure you're not hurt?

01:23:19.410 --> 01:23:19.880
Yes.

01:23:21.640 --> 01:23:23.620
Come on, Miss Palmer.

01:23:24.280 --> 01:23:25.480
No tricks.

01:23:26.810 --> 01:23:30.000
Ryan, I have to go talk to that man.

01:23:30.800 --> 01:23:32.800
So I want you to go over there with my friends, okay?

01:23:33.250 --> 01:23:34.570
No, I want to stay with you.

01:23:34.670 --> 01:23:36.730
No, honey, you can't stay with me right now.

01:23:37.470 --> 01:23:40.130
But I promise you, everything is going to be okay.

01:23:42.390 --> 01:23:42.950
Are you scared?

01:23:43.230 --> 01:23:43.530
No.

01:23:44.690 --> 01:23:45.170
Boy.

01:24:44.490 --> 01:24:45.910
How nice of you all to join us.

01:25:25.920 --> 01:25:27.360
this up, he's starting to move.

01:25:45.800 --> 01:25:46.680
We'll snap it up.

01:26:08.640 --> 01:26:09.280
Caitlyn.

01:27:14.910 --> 01:27:15.410
Brady.

01:27:15.410 --> 01:27:16.780
Who's next?

01:27:16.780 --> 01:27:18.440
We are unless we move it.

01:27:18.440 --> 01:27:19.040
Here.

01:28:18.910 --> 01:28:20.070
Can you fly this thing?

01:28:20.070 --> 01:28:21.190
No.

01:28:21.190 --> 01:28:21.960
Good.

01:28:48.240 --> 01:28:52.050
Like I always said, think before you have kids.

01:28:53.810 --> 01:28:55.050
Yeah, but one of the parents is missing.

01:28:57.330 --> 01:28:57.630
Brady.

01:31:08.160 --> 01:31:11.420
Nice shootin'.

01:31:11.420 --> 01:31:17.410
Well, I couldn't let 'em skip out on their kid.
